#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:269
msgid "Colours, sizes, timing and the look of the focus effect are set in the section \"Design\" of this screen. Leave a field empty to keep the default; only the values you change are printed, as CSS custom properties on the .wpcf7 wrapper, right after the stylesheet."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:270
msgid "Themes can set the same properties in CSS, for example in Appearance > Customize > Additional CSS or a child theme. The snippet shows every property with the value in effect:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:272
msgid "To style one form only, replace .wpcf7 with the id of its wrapper, for example [id^=\"wpcf7-f123-\"], or with a class you add through the html_class attribute."
