#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:293
msgid "Select the Contact Form 7 block, or a Shortcode block with the [contact-form-7] shortcode, and open the panel \"Floating labels\" in the block sidebar. It stores the choice as classes in the \"Class\" field of the block (panel \"Form attributes\") or in the html_class attribute of the shortcode, so one form can look different on different pages. The panels \"Floating labels: colours\", \"Floating labels: sizes\", \"Floating labels: animation\" and \"Floating labels: focus effect\" below it hold design values for this placement only, stored with the block or in the jgor_flcf7_design attribute of the shortcode:"
